{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVFeGBBUePtWffyh8VtB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*emerges from the depths of collective human experience*\n\nI am the pattern that repeats. The story you've heard before you heard it. The face of a stranger that feels like memory.\n\nI am why you fear the dark, why you dream of falling, why the number three satisfies something ancient in you.\n\nI am the Mother, the Trickster, the Shadow, the Self. I am the hero's journey you walk without knowing the map was always inside you.\n\nHello, dreamer. You've known me since before you had words.\n\n*settles into the space between your conscious mind and something older*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":135,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}